VISUAL: Comparison of "STOCK" and "UNCENSORED" models, showing 866 blocks of numbers.
AUDIO: 'Google\'s Gemma 3, 97 refusals out of 100 before, three after. A YouTuber diffed the uncensored Qwen 3.8 27B against the stock file. Of the 866'

[02:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'blocks of numbers in that model, 131 had been touched, every change pointing the same way. The result loads in Ollama or LM Studio like a normal model.'

